        "id": 1361259
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-19T04:20:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Even if SM5803 needs something similar, I don\u0027t think it makes sense to have a \"global\" option if each driver does something on its own without requiring code outside the driver to know about the option.",
      "parentUuid": "d9d750f5_64422ec6",
      "revId": "c7a23f135043872e5c956347015a9e423a7a51ea",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
